      <ul>
        <li>Select lenders will waive LMI at up to 90% LVR for employees of banks and financial institutions.</li>
        <li>It is usually based on <em>where</em> you work, not the job title on your email signature. Data, digital, product, tech, risk and marketing commonly count.</li>
