    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">If you want that conversation, <a href="/book/">book a strategy session</a>. Thirty minutes on Google Meet. I will tell you what you qualify for, and whether your bank's policy or someone else's is the better deal, including "stay with the staff package" when that is the honest answer.</p>
