      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does using a broker cost bank staff anything?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Brokers are paid by the lender at settlement, and under the Best Interests Duty I am legally required to act in your interests. If the staff package is the better deal, that is what I should tell you. Twenty minutes on a call and you will know what you qualify for."
      }
    }
  ]
